    "unique_id": "typescript_ml_inference_expert_016",
    "name": "InsightHexaAI: Strategic ML Inference Suite for Enterprise KPIs",
    "description": "InsightHexaAI is an expert-level TypeScript platform that empowers large enterprises to turn predictive models into continuously-improving, revenue-impacting services. Centered on a strict hexagonal (ports-and-adapters) architecture, the project isolates core business logic\u2014profit-driven metrics, customer-lifetime-value forecasts, churn-risk scores\u2014from volatile outside concerns such as data lakes, BI tools, model registries, and visualization dashboards. \n\nEvery feature\u2014experiment_tracking, feature_store, model_versioning, automated_retraining, and real-time model_serving\u2014is expressed as a set of domain services inside the hexagon. External technologies (Kafka, S3, TensorFlow, Snowflake, PowerBI, etc.) are merely adapters, allowing the core to uphold business rules like SLA-aware inference pricing or regulatory audit trails. Strategy_Pattern and Factory_Pattern implementations let product managers swap revenue strategies (e.g., usage-based billing vs. subscription) or model-selection strategies (A/B vs. multi-armed bandit) without touching IO code. Observer_Pattern feeds dashboards and alerts whenever KPIs drift, while Pipeline_Pattern orchestrates preprocessing \u2192 feature_engineering \u2192 training \u2192 evaluation \u2192 deployment pipelines in code, not YAML, giving finance teams traceable cost attribution.\n\nWith 98 cohesive files planned (\u2248741 k tokens), InsightHexaAI becomes the authoritative backbone for enterprise ML operations, tightly aligning technical excellence with measurable business outcomes.",
